<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first</p>
<p>division after Friday's matches:</p>
<p>14 - Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes), David Zitelli (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>13 - Japhet N'Doram (Nantes)</p>
<p>11 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon)</p>
<p>10 - Miladin Becanovic (Lille), Anton Drobnjak (Bastia)</p>
<p>9 - Anderson (Monaco)</p>
<p>8 - Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux), Thierry Henry (Monaco), Julio</p>
<p>Cesar Dely Valdes (Paris St-Germain)</p>
<p>7 - Leonardo (Paris St-Germain), Victor Ikpeba (Monaco).</p>
